<!-- ===== 1. OVERVIEW ===== -->
<section class="section section--panel" id="overview">
  <div class="wrap split split--top">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow reveal" data-bm="Ringkasan">The brief</span>
      <h2 class="reveal" style="margin:1.1rem 0" data-bm="Kandungan kreator gagal apabila ia tidak konsisten.">Creator content fails when it is inconsistent.</h2>
      <p class="reveal" style="margin-bottom:1rem" data-bm="Jenama yang dipacu kreator hidup atau mati mengikut irama. Satu episod hebat diikuti tiga minggu senyap akan menghilangkan penonton yang mengambil masa berbulan untuk dikumpulkan. Ketiga-tiga jenama ini datang dengan masalah yang sama: mereka mempunyai idea dan personaliti, tetapi memerlukan mesin produksi di belakangnya.">Creator-led brands live or die by rhythm. One great episode followed by three quiet weeks loses an audience that took months to gather. All three of these brands arrived with the same problem: they had the ideas and the personalities, but needed a production machine behind them.</p>
      <p class="reveal" style="margin-bottom:1rem" data-bm="Kata Kita memerlukan set mingguan yang boleh menerima tetamu profil tinggi tanpa kelihatan berbeza setiap kali. SpaceDollah memerlukan kandungan yang berfungsi merentasi Instagram, Facebook, TikTok dan YouTube &mdash; empat platform, empat set peraturan. Flow State memerlukan liputan acara dan pentas podcast langsung yang berjalan serentak.">Kata Kita needed a weekly set that could take high-profile guests without looking different every time. SpaceDollah needed content that works across Instagram, Facebook, TikTok and YouTube &mdash; four platforms, four sets of rules. Flow State needed event coverage and a live podcast stage running at the same time.</p>
      <p class="reveal muted" data-bm="Pendekatan kami sama untuk ketiga-tiganya: kunci rupa, kunci aliran kerja, kemudian biarkan kandungan bergerak pantas di dalamnya.">Our approach is the same for all three: lock the look, lock the workflow, then let the content move fast inside it.</p>
      <div class="chip-row reveal" style="margin-top:1.8rem">
        <span class="chip chip--ghost" data-bm="Mingguan">Weekly cadence</span>
        <span class="chip chip--ghost" data-bm="Multi-platform">Multi-platform</span>
        <span class="chip chip--ghost" data-bm="Rakaman langsung">Live capture</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="split__media split__media--wide reveal">
      <span class="frame" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <img src="assets/img/katakita-3.jpg" alt="Kata Kita podcast hosts and a guest mid-conversation on set" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap" style="margin-top:4rem">
    <div class="section-head reveal" style="margin-bottom:2rem">
      <span class="eyebrow" data-bm="Apa yang kami serahkan">What we delivered</span>
      <h2 data-bm="Tiga jenama, tiga aliran kerja.">Three brands, three workflows.</h2>
    </div>
    <ol class="step-list step-list--2">
      <li class="step-list__item reveal">
        <h3 data-bm="Kata Kita &mdash; podcast mingguan">Kata Kita &mdash; weekly podcast</h3>
        <p data-bm="Produksi episod mingguan bersama tokoh awam dan personaliti industri, dengan komuniti kira-kira 39K di @katakitapodcast.">Weekly episode production with public figures and industry personalities, for a community of roughly 39K at @katakitapodcast.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step-list__item reveal">
        <h3 data-bm="SpaceDollah &mdash; kandungan digital">SpaceDollah &mdash; digital content</h3>
        <p data-bm="Produksi kandungan digital untuk Instagram, Facebook, TikTok dan YouTube &mdash; konsep, penggambaran, suntingan dan penyerahan mengikut platform.">Digital content production for Instagram, Facebook, TikTok and YouTube &mdash; concept, shoot, edit and platform-specific delivery.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step-list__item reveal">
        <h3 data-bm="Flow State &mdash; liputan acara">Flow State &mdash; event coverage</h3>
        <p data-bm="Liputan acara penuh: pentas, khalayak dan suasana, dengan potongan sosial disiapkan semasa acara masih berjalan.">Full event coverage: stage, crowd and atmosphere, with social cutdowns turned around while the event is still running.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="step-list__item reveal">
        <h3 data-bm="Flow State &mdash; podcast langsung">Flow State &mdash; live podcast</h3>
        <p data-bm="Pentas podcast langsung di dalam acara &mdash; dirakam sebagai persembahan dan dipakej semula sebagai episod selepas acara.">A live podcast stage inside the event &mdash; captured as a performance and repackaged as post-event episodes.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== 2. KATA KITA ===== -->
