      <h2 data-bm="Satu set yang boleh menerima sesiapa sahaja.">A set that can take anyone.</h2>
      <p class="lead muted" data-bm="Kata Kita menerima tokoh awam dan personaliti industri setiap minggu. Set itu perlu terasa seperti tempat yang sama setiap kali &mdash; itulah yang membina komuniti ~39K di @katakitapodcast.">Kata Kita hosts public figures and industry personalities every week. The set has to feel like the same place every time &mdash; that is what built the ~39K community at @katakitapodcast.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="showcase reveal">
      <div class="showcase__media">
        <img src="assets/img/katakita-2.jpg" alt="Wide view of the Kata Kita podcast set during a weekly recording" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1400" height="787">
      </div>
      <div class="showcase__card">
        <span class="chip" data-bm="Podcast mingguan">Weekly podcast</span>
        <h3 data-bm="Irama mengalahkan kesempurnaan.">Rhythm beats perfection.</h3>
        <p data-bm="Satu susun atur tetap, kedudukan kamera tetap, aliran audio tetap. Apabila teknikal berhenti menjadi soalan, hari rakaman menjadi lebih pendek, tetamu lebih santai, dan penerbitan mingguan menjadi realistik &mdash; bukan janji.">One fixed layout, fixed camera positions, fixed audio flow. When the technical side stops being a question, record days get shorter, guests are more relaxed, and a weekly release becomes realistic rather than aspirational.</p>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" style="margin-top:1.4rem" href="https://www.instagram.com/katakitapodcast" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-bm="@katakitapodcast di Instagram">@katakitapodcast on Instagram</a>
