<!-- ===== 4. FLOW STATE ===== -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head reveal" style="margin-bottom:2.8rem">
      <span class="eyebrow" data-bm="03 &middot; Flow State">03 &middot; Flow State</span>
      <h2 data-bm="Liputan acara dan podcast langsung, serentak.">Event coverage and a live podcast, at the same time.</h2>
      <p class="lead muted" data-bm="Flow State menuntut dua produksi berjalan selari di bawah satu bumbung: kru liputan yang mengejar pentas dan khalayak, dan pasukan podcast yang merakam perbualan langsung di tengah-tengah acara.">Flow State asked for two productions running in parallel under one roof: a coverage crew chasing stage and crowd, and a podcast team recording live conversation in the middle of the event.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="showcase showcase--left reveal">
      <div class="showcase__media">
        <img src="assets/img/flowstate-1.jpg" alt="Flow State main stage lit for a live event production" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1400" height="787">
